e this early stone building visually legible from the corridor.","evidence_claim":"The Annville Heritage Trail identifies the Batdorf Building at 103 W. Main Street as a nine-bay stone building dating from 1810, with a cut-stone front and rubble side walls.","source_url":"https://lebanonvalleyconservancy.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/tlvc-heritage-trail-annville-2023.pdf","source_title":"Annville Heritage Trail Map","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":"2023-10","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Batdorf%20Building%20103%20W%20Main%20St%20Annville%20PA%2017003","access_notes":"Observe the exterior from the public sidewalk; interior access is not established by the source.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"oddfellows-hall-annville","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Oddfellows’ Hall","title":"Read Three Floors of Civic History","subtitle":"West Main Street corridor · 219 W. Main St.","notes":"Study the exterior while matching each floor to its former jail, fire-company, auditorium, and lodge uses in the trail guide.","short_summary":"One compact building records several former civic and community functions.","evidence_claim":"The Annville Heritage Trail identifies Oddfellows’ Hall at 219 W. Main Street and documents former uses including a jail, fire company, public auditorium, and lodge rooms.","source_url":"https://lebanonvalleyconservancy.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/tlvc-heritage-trail-annville-2023.pdf","source_title":"Annville Heritage Trail Map","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":"2023-10","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Oddfellows%20Hall%20219%20W%20Main%20St%20Annville%20PA%2017003","access_notes":"The building contains living units; observe quietly from the public sidewalk and do not enter.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"washington-house-annville","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Washington House","title":"Find the Corner Doorway and Pent Eaves","subtitle":"West Main Street corridor · 245 W. Main St.","notes":"Use the trail description to locate the original corner entrance, pent eaves, stone lintels, and boxed cornice.","short_summary":"A cluster of documented exterior details distinguishes this circa-1795 former hotel.","evidence_claim":"The Annville Heritage Trail identifies Washington House at 245 W. Main Street as a hotel built around 1795 with an original corner doorway, pent eaves, stone lintels, and boxed cornice.","source_url":"https://lebanonvalleyconservancy.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/tlvc-heritage-trail-annville-2023.pdf","source_title":"Annville Heritage Trail Map","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":"2023-10","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Washington%20House%20245%20W%20Main%20St%20Annville%20PA%2017003","access_notes":"Observe architectural details from the public sidewalk; interior public access is not established.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"log-house-annville","subject_type":"street_or_district","entity_name":"Log House","title":"Look for the Saltbox Roofline","subtitle":"West Main Street corridor · 437 W. Main St.","notes":"Finish westward by identifying the steep saltbox roofline described for this pre-Revolution house on the heritage trail.","short_summary":"A steep roof profile marks one of the corridor’s documented pre-Revolution structures.","evidence_claim":"The Annville Heritage Trail identifies the Log House at 437 W. Main Street as a pre-Revolution New England saltbox-style house with a steep roof.","source_url":"https://lebanonvalleyconservancy.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/tlvc-heritage-trail-annville-2023.pdf","source_title":"Annville Heritage Trail Map","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":"2023-10","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Log%20House%20437%20W%20Main%20St%20Annville%20PA%2017003","access_notes":"Private residence; view the roofline from the public sidewalk and do not enter the property.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
